id: TERM32-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: clarify_lines
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:         Judgment::Rejected(_) | Judgment::Clarified(_) | Judgment::Accepted(Some(_))
replace:         Judgment::Rejected(_) | Judgment::Accepted(Some(_))
expect-fail: 引数なしの_new_idea_は_clarified_の行になり_拒否の行に数えない
note: 問い返しの文面の控えを作らない（行が出ない）
